			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">I will sing and make melody with all my being !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">I will awake the dawn !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">I will sing praises to you among the nations .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">your faithfulness reaches to the clouds .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">Let your glory be over all the earth !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">give salvation by your right hand and answer me !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">and portion out the Valley of Succoth .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">Judah my scepter .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">
				<crossref let="s" cid="c19108009.1" />over Philistia I shout in triumph . ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">Who will lead me to Edom ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">You do not go out , O God , with our armies .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">for vain is the salvation of man !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">it is he who will tread down our foes .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19108014">
			</marker>
